
test_bind
 osmo_sccp_user_bind(inst, name='msc-0', ssn=254)
 backend 'local', wraps the bound SCCP user, registered as its priv
 one allocation (the bsc_sccp_user) below the given ctx
 get_sccp() and get_bsc_sccp() resolve through the SCCP user and instance

test_bind_fails
 osmo_sccp_user_bind() failure -> NULL, nothing allocated, priv not touched

test_find
 bound user found: returns the same bsc_sccp_user (ssn=254 pc=0x123 passed through)
 no user: returns NULL

